.2.2 0 0 1 0-.283l4.356-4.355h-3.786a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2V3.2c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2H16v5.371a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2h-.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2zm-6.5 6.9v.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2H3v-5.371c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2h.529c.11 0 .2.09.2.2v3.786l4.355-4.356a.2.2 0 0 1 .283 0l.374.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0 .283L4.585 15.07h3.786c.11 0 .2.09.2.2z\" fill=\"#000\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\"></path></svg></button></div></figure></div></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><em><span>Step 3:</span></em><span>​</span></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><em><span>Shake it thoroughly then dip your crackers or bread in for a nice treat!  My mom made this bread, and it sure is perfect for the occasion~</span></em></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>"
